  "contentHtml": "<p>4월에 실시한 과학의 달 행사 프로그램 중에서 폐품 활용 창작 부문의 산출물을 소개합니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 준비물: 폐품(개별 준비)</p><p>2. 창작 및 설명서 작성 시간: 90분</p><p>3. 취지: 환경 보전</p><p>&#160;</p><p>폐품을 활용하여 쓸모있는 그 무엇(장식품, 생활용품 등 어떤 것이든지 가능)을 만들되, 분해하여 폐품 재활용하기 어려운 접착제(양면 테이프, 글루건, 본드류 등) 사용 금지. 크기는 A4용지 이내, 높이는 30cm 이하</p><p>&#160;</p><p>올해 처음 재직하게 된 이 학교에서는 처음 실시하는 주제이며, 아이디어가 돋보이는 기발한 작품들이 많이 나왔습니다. 소녀들이 유난히 꽃을 많이 만드네요.&#160; ^^</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/121fea9024e8d28b9c2b962d7d0c719f121ca195\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/121fea9024e8d28b9c2b962d7d0c719f121ca195\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/25fd0cc6c2af2ceeeff7bc730ceb260322cae7b7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/25fd0cc6c2af2ceeeff7bc730ceb260322cae7b7\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06c7943070b74d7420d4d6327b4117aab68b27a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06c7943070b74d7420d4d6327b4117aab68b27a3\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3b150ac7e041926506f8bfc24411303a9d7e805\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3b150ac7e041926506f8bfc24411303a9d7e805\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31f24df93cecd6af98e9d203893de54f9439e549\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31f24df93cecd6af98e9d203893de54f9439e549\" data-origin-width=\"661\" data-origin-height=\"696\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f77e746b0a8b8c0328a7ca020105906277c2d136\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f77e746b0a8b8c0328a7ca020105906277c2d136\" data-origin-width=\"1073\" data-origin-height=\"595\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50f337f295112da09e754013b26aef4b59e47157\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50f337f295112da09e754013b26aef4b59e47157\" data-origin-width=\"651\" data-origin-height=\"890\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e63f226973300b40b2ff734029d13ba50e49bb9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e63f226973300b40b2ff734029d13ba50e49bb9\" data-origin-width=\"876\" data-origin-height=\"684\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
